<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In our Brother’s resurrection</l><l>Resurrected we must meet,</l><l>Never in our natural standing—</l><l>This will make His joy complete!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Every day we must see Jesus</l><l>As we’re eating of the Word;</l><l>Then we’ll run to all the meetings</l><l>Burning, bubbling with the Lord!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>In the meetings we are feasting</l><l>On the food unlimited.</l><l>Jesus always satisfies us,</l><l>Feeding us the living bread!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>We would satisfy our Brother,</l><l>Even though our portion’s small.</l><l>Every one must share his “new dish”</l><l>For the benefit of all!</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Not for message or for speaker,</l><l>But to meet the Lord we’re here;</l><l>Caring only for His presence,</l><l>We would see our Brother dear!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
